---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
const pageTitle = "Ladislav's gallery";
---

<BaseLayout pageTitle={pageTitle}>
  <main class="main-container">
    <div class="container about">
      <h2>About</h2>
      <h3>Why I paint?</h3>
      <p>
        Painting for me, is the act of creating beauty with my hands... a quiet conversation between myself and the
        person who will one day see the work. It’s an attempt to understand what beauty means to both of us. Painting is
        unpredictable. I can never fully control the outcome, but I can begin with intention and trust the process as it
        unfolds.
      </p>
      <br />
      <p>
        Every piece starts with an idea, something I hope will resonate with you and make you feel something genuine. As
        I paint, I challenge myself to go further than before, to make the next brushstroke more honest, more alive. If
        a work feels merely “good,” I let it go and begin again.
      </p>
      <br />
      <a
        href="mailto:ladislav.studio@proton.me?subject=Saying%20hello"
        class="mail-link"
        title="Email"
        aria-label="Send email">Get in touch</a
      >
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
